  "On even rounds, the die gives the number of actions before flooding. Every adjacent ocean coast without a dike adds 1 water. Build a dike": "在偶數回合，骰子決定洪水前的行動次數。每個沒有堤防的相鄰海岸加1點水量。建造堤防",
  "On even rounds, the die gives the number of actions before flooding. Every adjacent ocean coast without a dike adds 1 water. Build a dike {p0} for {p1} with the Build action. At 5 waters an island sinks; if 3 islands sink, everyone loses. Each hut on an island with 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 waters loses 1 / 3 / 5 / 7 prosperity at game end.": "在偶數回合，骰子決定洪水前的行動次數。每個沒有堤防的相鄰海岸加1點水量。使用建造行動建造堤防 {p0}，花費 {p1}。水量達5時島嶼沉沒；若有3座島嶼沉沒，所有人落敗。遊戲結束時，水量為1 / 2 / 3 / 4的島嶼上每間小屋損失1 / 3 / 5 / 7點繁榮。",
  "Once per round, exchange up to 3 prosperity for the same number of vatus.": "每回合一次，最多將3點繁榮換成等量的瓦圖。",
