  "Place 2, then 3 neutral markers before choosing characters. You must also beat the neutral stack to act; the matching character lets you tie it. Available characters change each round. Boats cannot end their movement on the same space.": "選擇角色前，先放置2個、再放置3個中立標記。要行動還必須超過中立堆疊；對應角色可讓你與之平手。可用角色每回合更換。船隻不能結束在相同格子上。",
  "Place five markers and understand action majorities.": "放置五個標記，了解如何由標記最多的玩家優先執行行動。",
  "Place the neutral markers": "放置中立標記",
  "Place the two markers first.": "先放置兩個標記。",
  "Place your fifth marker. During the action phase, ties are broken in order from the first player.": "放置第五個標記。行動階段若標記數量相同，從起始玩家開始，依回合順序決定優先權。",
  "Place your first two markers. Sailing opens up fishing and island actions; extra markers help win a majority.": "放置你的前兩個標記。航行可開啟捕魚和島嶼行動；額外標記有助於贏得多數。",
  "Placer les pions neutres": "放置中立棋子",
  "Placez d’abord 2, puis 3 pions neutres. Pour agir, il faut aussi dépasser leur nombre ; le personnage correspondant permet de les égaler. Les personnages disponibles changent chaque tour. Deux bateaux ne peuvent pas terminer leur déplacement sur la même case.": "先放置2個、再放置3個中立棋子。要行動還必須超過其數量；對應角色可讓你與之平手。可用角色每回合更換。兩艘船不能結束在相同格子上。",
